    "description": "swissALTIRegio is a medium-resolution digital terrain model (10m). It describes the surface without vegetation and buildings. Switzerland and the Principality of Liechtenstein, as well as parts of the neighbouring countries of France, Italy, Austria and Germany are included in the data set. Updates within Switzerland and the Principality of Liechtenstein are carried out annually, while the other areas are updated when source data is available.",
